# The .wasm/.zkey witness generators and proving keys the test suite actually
# loads (see tests/unit/*-e2e.test.ts) — a bare `build/` pattern above used to
# match circuits/*/build/ before it could reach these more specific rules, so
# a fresh clone (including CI) never had these files despite the exceptions
# above. These are dev-ceremony artifacts (single local contributor,
# /dev/urandom entropy — see docs/POC_IMPLEMENTATION.md), fine for
# testnet/CI use and explicitly not suitable for production; committing them
# is what makes the e2e proof tests runnable from a clean checkout at all.
!circuits/shield/build/shield_js/
!circuits/shield/build/shield_js/shield.wasm
!circuits/shield/build/shield.zkey
